desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java RC4 Cipher"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java RC4/ARCFOUR 加密"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-rc4-cipher"
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 Cipher 使用 RC4 或 ARCFOUR。该流密码存在多种实际攻击。

### 风险类型
weak-cryptographic-algorithm

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学原语，若处理外部数据或用于安全场景，可能导致命令执行、代码执行、反序列化或机密性破坏。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
停止使用 RC4，改用 AES-GCM 或 ChaCha20-Poly1305。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://Crypt.java": <<<POS
import javax.crypto.Cipher;
class Crypt {
  void bad() throws Exception {
    Cipher.getInstance("RC4");
  }
}
POS
	"safefile://CryptSafe.java": <<<NEG
class CryptSafe {
  void ok() {
    System.out.println("aes-gcm");
  }
}
NEG
)

Cipher.getInstance(*?{have: "RC4"}) as $call
Cipher.getInstance(*?{have: "ARCFOUR"}) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Weak RC4 Cipher",
	title_zh: "弱加密 RC4",
	message: "结构扫描：Java RC4/ARCFOUR 加密",
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm",
}
